<title>UK: Sullom Voe liftings over million tonnes last week.</title>
<headline>Sullom Voe liftings over million tonnes last week.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brent blend loadings from Britain's Sullom Voe terminal jumped to 1,022,557 tonnes in the week to January 28 from 589,887 tonnes the previous week, Shetland Islands Marine Operations said.</p>
<p>Just over 47 percent of the oil, 480,666 tonnes, was destined for refineries in North America.</p>
<p>Shipments to northwest Europe slumped dramatically although sailing to the U.S did pick up.</p>
